NNAAMMEE
       pnmtopclxl  -  convert  a  PNM  image  to an HP LaserJet PCL XL printer
       stream


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppnnmmttooppccllxxll

       { [--ddppii==_N] [--xxooffffss==_N] [--yyooffffss==_N] [--cceenntteerr]  [--dduupplleexx=={vveerrttiiccaall|hhoorriizzoonn‐‐
       ttaall}]   [--ffoorrmmaatt==_p_a_p_e_r_f_o_r_m_a_t]   [--ffeeeeddeerr==_N]  [--ccooppiieess==_N]  [--rreennddeerrggrraayy]
       [--jjoobbsseettuupp==_f_i_l_e_n_a_m_e]

       | --eemmbbeeddddeedd

       } [--ccoolloorrookk] _p_n_m_f_i_l_e_1 _p_n_m_f_i_l_e_2 ...

       Minimum unique abbreviation of option is acceptable.  You may use  dou‐
